            },
            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "Here's my attempt to keep FieldCaches per index reader.\n\nNot well documented, but it's rather a prototype anyway.\n\nWDYT?",
          "updateAuthor": {
